{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The client SDK for "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/superwall.com","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", a service that lets you remotely configure, present and iterate paywalls – helping you find winners quickly."}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/UserSeeds"]},{"anchor":"Customer-Center","title":"Customer Center","identifiers":["doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/CustomerCenter","doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/macOS","doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit\/WatchAndTV"]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/superwallkit\/superwallkit"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Superwall makes it easy to show paywalls in your app using UIKit or SwiftUI. If you haven’t already, "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/superwall.com\/sign-up","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Configure the SDK with your API key and present our example paywall in response to a registered placement. When you’re ready to use your own paywalls, head to the Superwall dashboard and use the paywall editor to configure them. Then, create a Campaign and define audiences to determine when to show paywalls to users."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"See our "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/docs.superwall.com\/docs","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for more information."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation\/SuperwallKit"]]},"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/superwall-ios.SuperwallKit\/documentation